# The bass's answer (0.17.30, the Bass answer page, LFO x6; a Reddit player's "an answer for every voice"): its kind (K1, the piece's, fxs97), when (K2,
# fxs98: every 2nd .. 8th bar, Drift, with the acid's answer, the bar after it), the acid answer's kind beside it (K3), the line's mode (K4).
# And the SOUND page (0.17.30, the settings' walk, last): Vintage, Polish, Tilt, Width (fxs99 .. 102).
seed 0
wait 500
tap GLO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
expect view 11
# a line to answer with (Root), an octave every second bar
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect par152 1
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect fxs97 1
spin K2 -20
wait 100
expect fxs98 0
shot bass_answer_page.png
waitfor bassans 1 6000
waitfor bassans 0 6000
waitfor bassans 1 6000
# the call and response: the acid answers (an octave up), the bass the bar after
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect par151 8
spin K2 20
wait 100
expect fxs98 9
waitfor acidans 1 30000
waitfor acidans 0 6000
expect bassans 1
# the SOUND page: the settings' walk, its eleventh
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 10
wait 100
expect fxpage 35
expect fxs99 30
expect fxs100 1
expect fxs101 1
expect fxs102 30
spin K1 10
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect fxs99 40
expect fxs101 2
shot sound_page.png
